    en: { name: "Sheikh Zayniddin Bobo Mausoleum", desc: "A quiet corner of the old Kukcha quarter with the mausoleum of Sheikh Zayniddin Bobo, a preacher of the Suhrawardiyya Sufi order whom tradition calls the son of its founder. The domed mausoleum dates from the 16th century, and next to it survives an underground chillakhana cell where, legend says, the sheikh spent forty-day retreats in prayer. Around it are an old cemetery, a mosque and a tree-lined yard. An active shrine: dress modestly." },
    uz: { name: "Shayx Zayniddin bobo maqbarasi", desc: "Eski Koʻkcha dahasining sokin goʻshasi — rivoyatlarga koʻra Suhravardiya tariqati asoschisining oʻgʻli boʻlgan voiz Shayx Zayniddin bobo maqbarasi. Gumbazli maqbara XVI asrda qurilgan, yonida esa rivoyatga koʻra shayx qirq kunlik xilvatda ibodat qilgan yer osti chillaxonasi saqlangan. Atrofida qadimiy qabriston, masjid va daraxtzor hovli. Faol ziyoratgoh: odobli kiyimda kiring." },
